      ],
      "id" : "F5791832-E5D5-45F2-86DF-40D1A66A57A2",
      "note" : "# Coordinate Conversion\n\nThese Nodes Convert from 2d positions to 3d positions, and then to transforms we can use for instanced rendering\n\nLeaving a compose port empty makes it 0 :) "
    },
    {
      "rect" : [
        [
          -1216.60674361178,
          -231.54826505383153
        ],
        [
          291.73887873261447,
          683.1528952506314
        ]
      ],
      "id" : "A2C4BA15-D7F2-4051-A3F0-7AB614B663E9",
      "note" : "# Array Combine\n\nWe can combine all our data into a single array since we treat all points the same drawing wise!"
    },
    {
      "rect" : [
        [
          -1732.9351561768485,
          -227.23445944869673
        ],
        [
          501.1970204684412,
          678.9471655159587
        ]
      ],
      "id" : "D1DABD93-7649-4223-9B7A-01D77A9CA76A",
      "note" : "# Face Pose Analysis\n\nWe can output positions for each area of the face we are tracking\n\nWe use an Image Mesh to draw our background"
    }
